  "posts": [
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great energy in Delaware County tonight. Looking forward to Election Day for the primary tomorrow!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051469350297886846",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T01:09:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I\u2019ll lead Ohio to be in the top 5 for economic growth &amp; educational achievement, not property taxes. We\u2019ll fix this in 2027 &amp; deliver the biggest property tax rollback in the history of our state.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051461560896475392",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T00:38:45+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A man who attended his first-ever political event asked me a pragmatic question about infrastructure &amp; I told him the truth: the less money we squander on waste, fraud, and abuse, the more money we\u2019ll have to spend on worthy infrastructure improvements.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051440845967253546",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T23:16:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We will root out fraud, prosecute it aggressively, &amp; return the money to law-abiding Ohioans.\n\n\nLuke Rosiak (@lukerosiak)\n\nx.com/i/article/205129714956\u2026\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/lukerosiak/status/2051299750188642790#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051440367787266551",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T23:14:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lower costs. Bigger paychecks. Better schools. Coming in 2027, right after we win.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051412214104682922",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T21:22:39+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Uncomfortable truth for my opponent: you can\u2019t complain about inequity while enacting policies that create that inequity. The public school closures were unforgivable &amp; we\u2019re still suffering the consequences today.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051392370168762452",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T20:03:48+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Awesome to see my family member Jim, a Navy veteran, show up at an event like this (it was a first). Grateful to the veterans across our state &amp; in my hometown of Cincinnati, we\u2019ll always have your back.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051334559179100528",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T16:14:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I refuse to tolerate this kind of waste, fraud, &amp; abuse in Medicaid. We\u2019ll prosecute aggressively &amp; put the money back in the pockets of law-abiding Ohioans. The dollar amount will be far greater than most people expect.\n\n\nDaily Wire (@realDailyWire)\n\nYou are not ready for what @lukerosiak uncovered in Ohio. This is huge \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nMedicaid Millionaires: How The Feds Pay Immigrants Billions To Hang Out With Their\u00a0Families\n\ndailywire.com/news/medicaid-\u2026\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/realDailyWire/sta",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051316885137043893",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T15:03:51+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The Democratic Party has taken Black voters for granted for far too long &amp; they\u2019re ready for a new direction. This man courageously spoke a hard truth on Friday night in Cincinnati. Get ready, Ohio Democrats. \ud83d\udc40\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051107743382294784",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T01:12:48+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Grateful for moments like this every day. The St. X Long Blue Line is alive &amp; well. \u2764\ufe0f \ud83d\ude4f\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051050496409149561",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-03T21:25:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A friendly surprise &amp; a blast from the past in Cincinnati on Friday night. Good to see you, Mr. Odioso! Let\u2019s make St. X proud. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051031835531223402",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-03T20:11:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "You should be able to go to a ballgame &amp; enjoy dinner in downtown Cincinnati (or Columbus, or Cleveland, or Toledo) without fear of being mugged. That\u2019s part of the American Dream &amp; we\u2019ll restore it in Ohio.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051017071874773036",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-03T19:12:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "So grateful to our state &amp; our country for giving me the chance to live the American Dream\u2014something that isn\u2019t possible in any other nation on Earth. My faith teaches me it\u2019s my moral duty to use those blessings to leave this place even better than I found it. And we will.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050952326480105577",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-03T14:55:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Congrats to Ohio State men\u2019s &amp; women\u2019s tennis teams for NCAA tournament wins today. Cold day, tough conditions, didn\u2019t matter. Onwards! \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\ud83c\udfbe\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050711454391972072",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T22:58:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Cut the tax &amp; regulatory burden to bring high-paying jobs back to our state in droves. That\u2019ll lift up the workers we met this week in Richfield &amp; across Ohio. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050628967032569867",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T17:30:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lower costs, bigger paychecks, better schools.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050614344480915637",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T16:32:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We can be the top state in the country again. But that requires the right leader &amp; that\u2019s what November is all about.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050608893328531608",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T16:10:33+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A friend of the people is an enemy of bureaucracy. We\u2019re going to cut red tape &amp; unleash energy production in Ohio. That\u2019s how we bring down electric bills for the long run.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050591253763600830",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T15:00:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "An incredible town hall with some emotional moments last night in Cincinnati. You\u2019re counting on us &amp; we won\u2019t let you down. \ud83d\ude4f",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050565722229911710",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T13:19:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great to go clay shooting with supporters &amp; friends in central Ohio, before we headed to our absolutely massive town hall in Cincinnati tonight. Might have been our best day yet.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050401640721850400",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T02:27:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
