      },
      {
        "quote": "Cut the tax &amp; regulatory burden to bring high-paying jobs back to our state in droves. That\u2019ll lift up the workers we met this week in Richfield &amp; across Ohio. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\nVideo",
